// std.vulkan.video: the Vulkan video codec registry's types for H.264 and
// H.265 decoding (vk_video/vulkan_video_codec_h264std.h, _h264std_decode.h,
// _h265std.h, _h265std_decode.h), as the VK_KHR_video_decode_h264 and
// _h265 structures of std.vulkan point to them: enumerations as u32
// constants, flag bit-fields packed into a u32 from bit 0 (the C ABI),
// arrays and pointers as in C. Materialized from
// std/registry/vulkan/video.xml by video_materialize.py; do not edit.

